{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "11089d0d-d960-8023-a088-c1a5d407b175",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T10:27:21-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Conceicao Moniz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I'm calling about early voting. When does it start, and what are the dates?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Is this for a specific election? There isn't one citywide right this minute, so I want to make sure I give you the right information."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Whatever's the next one. I just want to know ahead of time. I'm renting, I move around, so I like to have it straight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:30-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. Early voting, or what the state calls in-person early voting, opens up a set number of days before an election, and the dates get set once the election is officially scheduled. When it's scheduled, we post the dates and locations on the city website and the Secretary of State's site."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So nothing posted yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing for you to act on right now, no."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] Sorry, hang on, there's a lot of rain. I'm walking to work, going past the shops on Thames, all the windows are fogged up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you picked a day for it. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's fine. That's the way it goes. So what about the deadline? To register, I mean. Is there a cutoff?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. There's a registration cutoff ahead of each election, and it's about a month out. Exact date depends on the election. If you've moved since you last registered, you'd want to update your address before that cutoff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did move in the spring. Never changed it, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:36-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then I'd update it soon, so you don't have to think about it later. You can do it online through the state, or you can come by the office and fill out a form. Or I can mail you one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll do it online. Easier."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Do you want me to take a number in case we need to reach you when the dates are set?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nah, I'll check the website. But if you need it, it's 401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0197. I'll note it, but you're right, the website is the quickest way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's all I needed. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Stay dry out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Trying. Bye."
    }
  ],
